        target="_blank"
        rel="sponsored noopener"
      >
        Check rates and availability at Paso Robles Inn
      </a>
    </p>

    <h3>Allegretto Vineyard Resort — Best for a Special Getaway</h3>

    <p>
      A resort-style property with vineyard surroundings,
      particularly suited to couples or travelers who want
      the hotel itself to be part of the Paso Robles experience.
    </p>

    <p>
      Choose Allegretto if you prefer a destination resort
      experience over the convenience of staying downtown.
    </p>

    <p>
      <a
        href="https://expedia.com/affiliate/EmkV7JS"
        target="_blank"
        rel="sponsored noopener"
      >
        Check rates and availability at Allegretto Vineyard Resort
      </a>
    </p>

    <h3>Oxford Suites Paso Robles — Best for Practical Value</h3>

    <p>
      A comfortable alternative just outside the downtown core,
      with breakfast included and amenities that can help keep
      the overall cost of the weekend reasonable.
    </p>

    <p>
      <a
        href="https://expedia.com/affiliate/6Dc6rQj"
        target="_blank"
        rel="sponsored noopener"
      >
        Check rates and availability at Oxford Suites Paso Robles
      </a>
    </p>

    <h3>Check Paso Robles Hotel Availability</h3>

    <p>
      Compare current lodging options and availability for your
      travel dates.
    </p>

